[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 32282.308, "timestamp": "08:58:02", "text": "你好。所以，我們剛才去哪了？我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32285.75, "timestamp": "08:58:05", "text": "所以，我們現在採用的是基於時間的系統。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32288.23, "timestamp": "08:58:08", "text": "根據一天中的不同時間，它會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32293.35, "timestamp": "08:58:13", "text": "在 YouTube 上向觀眾展示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32295.23, "timestamp": "08:58:15", "text": "我得把它放到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32298.07, "timestamp": "08:58:18", "text": "Twitch 上直播。所以，如果你來到我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32301.43, "timestamp": "08:58:21", "text": "YouTube 直播間，你會看到「晚安」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32304.35, "timestamp": "08:58:24", "text": "、「早安」、「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32308.07, "timestamp": "08:58:28", "text": "下午好」之類的問候語"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32311.11, "timestamp": "08:58:31", "text": "。當我切換到我的「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32315.23, "timestamp": "08:58:35", "text": "稍後回來」模式或在 OBS 中開啟睡眠場景時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32319.51, "timestamp": "08:58:39", "text": "，它會顯示沒有「稍後回來」模式。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32321.35, "timestamp": "08:58:41", "text": "我這樣做，它會像 joers 一樣告訴我什麼時候該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32323.99, "timestamp": "08:58:43", "text": "有他。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32326.788, "timestamp": "08:58:46", "text": "是下午，則會顯示午餐。如果是晚上，那就喝茶吃點心。如果是晚上，就吃晚餐。早上好，這是早餐時間。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32333.19, "timestamp": "08:58:53", "text": "好的，我先"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 32338.555, "timestamp": "08:58:58", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Joq went to have evening snackies~ do enjoy the vods till i come back nee~"}]